  <span class="l" data-style="q1">
    <span class="verse" data-osis-id="PSA 2:9" data-n="9"></span>You will break them<span class="note footnote" data-note-type="footnote" data-n="+" data-style="f"><span class="char" data-style="fr">2:9 </span><span class="char" data-style="ft">LXX </span><span class="char" data-style="fqa">You will rule them </span><span class="char" data-style="ft">or </span><span class="char" data-style="fqa">You will shepherd them</span></span> with an iron scepter;</span><br class="l">
  <span class="l" data-style="q2">You will shatter them like pottery.<span class="note footnote" data-note-type="footnote" data-n="+" data-style="f"><span class="char" data-style="fr">2:9 </span><span class="char" data-style="ft">Cited in Revelation 2:27; see also Revelation 12:5 and Revelation 19:15.</span></span>”</span><br class="l">
  <br class="lb" data-style="b">
  <span class="l" data-style="q1">
    <span class="verse" data-osis-id="PSA 2:10" data-n="10"></span>Therefore be wise, O kings;</span><br class="l">
